{
  "about": "Dice vectors for both rollers, derived by hand from the upstream C# at commit 8e2c2cc (VRPG2/Scripts/Components/DiceRollerDS.cs = DS, VRPG2/Scripts/Systems/D&D 5E/DiceRoller5E.cs = D5E, VRPG2/Scripts/Core/VRPGLogs.cs = LOG). `rolls` are the values Random.Range(min, max) returns, in call order; `ranges` the (min, max) of each call. The roller's display name is Ann. `log` is the log the line lands in (OOC or GM) and `lines` what the box holds afterwards, without the leading line break LOG:117 / LOG:124-128 put in front. Not generated by compiling the C#: no dotnet toolchain and no VRChat SDK assembly were used (PORT.md Q13).",
